  "overview": "Auth0 Cosmos — Developer identity platform, FaktPro typography and high-contrast indigo accents",
  "dos": "- **Surface & Theme Polarity**: Crisp light (#FFF) canvas paired with `#FFF` component surfaces and `#212121` primary ink.\n- **Brand & Interactive Accent**: Primary actions and focus states anchor on `#44C7F4` with `#212121` label contrast.\n- **Typographic Voice**: Headings and UI controls set in `FaktPro` across 2 type steps.\n- **Component Geometry**: Buttons (`8px`), cards (`12px`), inputs, badges, and navigation bars share consistent spacing and border contrast."
